# default-deny (AGENTS.md §12): block everything, allowlist the product.
*
!*/

# --- allowlist: the deliverables ---
!.gitignore
!/README.md
!/init-project.ts
!/install-*/
!/install-*/**

# --- re-exclude junk inside allowed trees (last match wins) ---
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.DS_Store
.DS_Store
*.log
*.sqlite
